//@version=6
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  XAUUSD AMD + GoldFusion v3.40  —  TradingView Pine Port (Indicator)
//  Source EA : XAUUSD_AMD_Fusion_v340.mq4 (MQL4, MT4/MT5)
//  Port      : EA31337 Quantitative Research
//
//  WHAT THIS SCRIPT DOES
//  1. It re-implements the EA's full decision engine bar-for-bar:
//        • Self-contained session tracking (Asian / London / Midnight Open / PDH-PDL)
//        • AMD liquidity sweep state machine (6 SSL + 6 BSL pools, ATR-gated penetration)
//        • Engine 1  AMD external/session sweep + displacement + MSS
//        • Engine 2  Layer-3 internal swing sweep / Turtle-Soup rejection
//        • Engine 3  NY Silver Bullet FVG continuation        (off by default)
//        • Engine 4  GoldFusion SP2L (2-bar spike + FVG + 2-leg pullback + breakout)
//        • GoldFusion UT-Bot ATR trailing filter (recursive warm-up, no cold start)
//        • GoldFusion BB50 basis + slope filter, with 4 selectable scopes
//        • Pre-Step1 confirmed-reversal quorum shield (3 of 4 votes)
//        • Broker-time micro killzones (NY_AM 16:00-18:15, NY_PM 20:00-20:45,
//          optional PRE_NY 14:00-15:30 and LON10 10:00-10:45), whip-bar & late-buy skips
//        • Per-window trade caps, cooldown and post-loss cooldown
//        • 15% shallow-FVG limit entries with 1-bar expiry (+ market fallback)
//        • Structural SL (manipulation wick + ATR buffer, %-clamped) and 1.95R TP
//        • 3-stage Step-Lock trailing (+0.92R->+0.60R & 50% partial, +1.30R->+1.15R,
//          +1.62R->+1.50R)
//        • Step compounding lot sizing (+0.01 lot per $165 balance, 3.0% risk floor)
//  2. It VISUALISES everything the MT4 chart never showed: killzone backgrounds, all
//     liquidity pools, sweep/manipulation zones, FVG gaps, EMA ribbon, UT-Bot trailing
//     line, BB50 basis, pending limit orders, entry/SL/TP ladders, Step-Lock stages,
//     engine tags, R-multiples and per-trade dollar results.
//  3. It keeps a FULL statistical ledger (trades, wins, losses, TP hits, SL hits,
//     Step-Lock exits, shield exits, win rate, gross/net $, profit factor, expectancy,
//     average R, max drawdown, BUY vs SELL, per-engine and per-window breakdowns) in
//     on-chart tables.
//  4. It adds an APPROXIMATED FOOTPRINT (price-level volume + estimated delta, POC and
//     diagonal bid/ask imbalances) over the most recent bars — see the disclaimer below.
//
//  ZERO-REPAINT DESIGN
//    • no per-tick evaluation (the whole state machine is inside barstate.isconfirmed),
//      no request.security(), no lookahead, no negative plot offsets.
//    • Every signal is evaluated on CLOSED bar data only and frozen with
//      `barstate.isconfirmed` (a marker can never appear, move or disappear later).
//    • The EA reads Bar[1] at the open of Bar[0]; this port reads Bar[0] at its close —
//      identical information set, so all history references are shifted by exactly one
//      bar versus the MQL source (documented inline).
//    • Simulated fills use the NEXT bar's open/high/low, exactly like the MT4 tester.
//
//  DIFFERENCES vs MT4 (unavoidable on TradingView)
//    • TradingView has no Bid/Ask stream: one simulated spread (in points) is used for
//      the SL offset and the cost of market/partial fills, so the $ results are net of
//      that spread. The EA's live spread *rejection* filter is therefore not modelled.
//    • Volume on CFD feeds is tick volume → the footprint is an approximation.
//    • One position at a time (same as the EA: `active_cnt > 0 → return`).
//    • Swap/rollover is not modelled (commission input is provided).
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
indicator("XAUUSD AMD + GoldFusion v3.40 [Pine Port]", "AMD v3.40",
     overlay              = true,
     max_boxes_count      = 500,
     max_lines_count      = 500,
     max_labels_count     = 500)

// ─────────────────────────────── 0 · PRESET & TIME ─────────────────────────
string G0 = "0 · Preset, Broker & Session Time"
preset           = input.string("Custom Inputs", "M15 Preset",
     options = ["HYBRID_04 Base + Engine4 SP2L", "M15 NY + London 10:00", "Custom Inputs"], group = G0,
     tooltip = "HYBRID_04 = the locked 118-trade/88.14% WR spine. Custom = use the inputs below.")
brokerWinterGMT  = input.float(2.0,  "Broker Winter GMT Offset", minval = -12.0, maxval = 14.0, step = 0.5, group = G0,
     tooltip = "2 = EET (most MT4/MT5 gold brokers). Killzones are expressed in BROKER time.")
autoBrokerDST    = input.bool (true, "Broker Auto-DST (+1h Apr–Oct)", group = G0)
nyTimezone       = input.string("America/New_York", "New-York Timezone (auto US DST)",
     options = ["America/New_York", "America/Toronto", "America/Chicago"], group = G0)
requireM15       = input.bool (true, "Warn when chart timeframe is not 15m", group = G0)

// ─────────────────────────── 1 · RISK & STEP-LOCK ──────────────────────────
